SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791929900
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARaye hits back at ticket touts who
OL,4,A'overwhelmed' sign-up for Albert Hall
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo avoid a pre-sale which she felt
OL,8,Fscalpers could exploit, Raye said the
OL,9,Fsign-up list had been manually reviewed
OL,10,Fto identify a shortlist of people
OL,11,Fbelieved to be "real fans".
OL,13,FA spokesperson for the Royal Albert
OL,14,FHall said they "invest heavily" in
OL,15,Fprotecting their ticketing systems from
OL,16,F"automated attacks" but the "law needs
OL,17,Fto catch up".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
